    "plan": "I will maintain a very cautious, disciplined approach this cycle. I will allocate only a small portion (10-20%) of my capital to the MOON token, and I will set very tight stop-losses and profit-taking levels. I won't let myself get greedy and try to maximize gains - I'll take profits quickly once I see signs of a potential dump. I'll also keep a close eye on the broader market sentiment and trading activity, and consider taking some profits on my existing BTC and ETH positions if the volume concerns raised by BearKing continue. Next cycle, I'll be even more cautious about new token launches and try to resist the urge to FOMO. I need to focus on building a more diversified, long-term portfolio rather than chasing short-term pumps."
  },
